{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4173ae13535197947a802d92cd89bb7df14d09f2837cf890fc566d3509713608",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2132958d0446eeb8f8372a7c568f1d25f27b70af8fed40a5e85256e3159fbff",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n我有件事想找您商量……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18076becafce3d286efed9e4465c89d81b0ef5918fa1bd8a8491b76b795b89ea",
      "text": "在水族馆宣传拍摄中穿的服装设计图，\n能提前让我过目一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1384233ea57d8d8d805e5a17195edd977b0eebf18484ec7dc5d8ef411d72e5ac",
      "text": "原本就打算\n明天给您看的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58caa5db819e18664539abd2a1f121c173178bd172c10e64360caa191622c4df",
      "text": "非常感谢，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c771592e7d999899cf5653624e4b9085bac0e291182163785ef77e40d1e449",
      "text": "我听说这次的服装是以人鱼为主题，\n而且还会有水下拍摄的环节。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc57fdd146113d7971922196cab9c69c82054e9911199b30a08a55f990df70b4",
      "text": "为了能展现出生活在海洋中的自然神态，我想投入更多的时间进行模拟训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60d8f768c0d871b5472d6f02b5fc98f06f814217fa189769b5faed3218120275",
      "text": "我正打算列出体态与服装形态接近的鱼类，并参考它们的生态习性。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7684edd9be8dc5b55c60c2e7cc243c05a54684000fcead75550d720d604123b",
      "text": "毕竟哪怕理论知识上了解其习性，要将其转化为肢体动作来表现，也绝非易事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c35b0b93a73da88cc24863461300321c3fd3f79668b62b0995a952d2ebb8fb1",
      "text": "真不愧是您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18458dc4af1f2f04e9b508b281a5276e34dee17c17d070b034af21665f17b609",
      "text": "毕竟这是一个能让更多人对海洋生物产生兴趣的大好机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34beab51b0a5fb33c8285cef79c0252f34ff38ded8c8da13a94c524bc3b30f40",
      "text": "凡是拍摄当天之前能做到的事，\n我都想全力以赴做好准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_402_2_4_046_02_09_b:2_4_046_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab63e60f74a9df9231f8c5fb7cd294a747d50a664985e17c632e5892fe63b173",
      "text": "我很期待能亲眼目睹成品的服装呢。\n那就先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
